  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forest Governance Assistance Project (FGAP) - Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FGAP is the Technical Assistance instrument of the Forest Governance, Markets, and Climate Programme (Phase 2). The project was designed  to closely address the objectives defined by Cameroon&apos;s Ministry of Forestry and Wildlife (MINFOF) to realise its vision for the forestry sector, through support to help operationalise Syst&#xe8;me Informatique de Gestion des Informations Foresti&#xe8;res (SIGIF2), the consolidation of national governance systems and their promotion at the international level, particularly amongst BMRC countries. This project will commence 2026 and will finish at the end of 2028 (3 years&#x2019; implementation phase).</narrative>
  </description>
